      "label": "paragraph",
      "full_gt_text": "No. 55/4/CF-66\nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA\nCABINET SECRETARIAT\n(Department of Cabinet Affairs)\n\nIMMEDIATE\n\nNew Delhi, the 31st January 1966.\n\nThe undersigned is directed to state that the designation of Shri A.M. Thomas, Minister of State in the Ministry of Defence will be as Minister of Defence Production in the Ministry of Defence.\n\n(D.P. Chopra)\nfor Cabinet Secretary.\n\nTo All Members of the Council of Ministers.\n\nCopy forwarded to the Secretary to the Prime Minister/ the Private Secretary to the Prime Minister, for information.\n\nP.T.O.",
